# Spellskite and a spell with two targets for one word "target" (CR 115.7b, the 2020-08-07 rulings): Bot2's Prismari Charm
# deals 1 damage to each of one or two targets, Bot1 and Bot1's Ornithopter. Spellskite changes a target, so only one of
# them can become Spellskite, and Bot1, who controls the ability, chooses which as it resolves (the choice is asked: both
# could change). Bot1 moves its own: the Charm then deals 1 to Spellskite and 1 to the Ornithopter, and none to Bot1.

